{"version":1,"content":"<p>今年9月，江西贛州一名來自低保（居民最低生活保障，相當於香港的綜援）家庭的女生，不顧家人和基層工作人員勸阻，來港看演唱會，從而觸發低保資格覆核程序。</p><p>荊楚網記者獲悉，低保已被取消。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T07:02:01.118954+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T06:15:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T06:58:32.740220+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:58:41.239757+00:00","content_hash":"5c849257a49671a10d264609b80e0cbda072174257d2cd12e7ad16938a7567b7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}